Paparan Analisis (Database View): laporan_analisis_kirkpatrick
Anda boleh membuat SQL View di Supabase untuk menggabungkan skor Pra dan Pasca secara terus:

SQL
CREATE VIEW laporan_analisis_kirkpatrick AS
SELECT 
    p.nama,
    p.no_kp,
    p.sektor_unit,
    pre.skor AS skor_pre,
    post.skor AS skor_post,
    (post.skor - pre.skor) AS lonjakan_markah,
    ROUND(((post.skor - pre.skor)::decimal / NULLIF((10 - pre.skor), 0)) * 100, 2) AS normalized_gain_percent
FROM peserta p
LEFT JOIN skor_kuiz pre ON p.no_kp = pre.no_kp AND pre.jenis_ujian = 'PRE'
LEFT JOIN skor_kuiz post ON p.no_kp = post.no_kp AND post.jenis_ujian = 'POST';
