Cara Pengiraan Dibuat Secara Automatik di Supabase:
Anda boleh membuat SQL View supaya aplikasi web boleh menarik purata terus tanpa memproses pengiraan berat di bahagian pelayar:

SQL
CREATE VIEW analisis_perbandingan_keseluruhan AS
SELECT 
    jenis_ujian,
    COUNT(*) AS jumlah_responden,
    ROUND(AVG(skor_total), 2) AS purata_skor,
    ROUND(AVG(q1) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q1,
    ROUND(AVG(q2) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q2,
    ROUND(AVG(q3) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q3,
    ROUND(AVG(q4) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q4,
    ROUND(AVG(q5) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q5,
    ROUND(AVG(q6) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q6,
    ROUND(AVG(q7) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q7,
    ROUND(AVG(q8) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q8,
    ROUND(AVG(q9) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q9,
    ROUND(AVG(q10) * 100, 1) AS peratus_betul_q10
FROM jawapan_kuiz
GROUP BY jenis_ujian;
